+// Small workspace switcher row for the bottom of the vertical sidebar: one
+// dot per workspace (with the name beside it while expanded) plus a button
+// for creating workspaces. Click switches, right-click offers rename/delete.
+// Hidden entirely when workspaces are unavailable (feature off, private or
+// non-normal windows). Uses only theme colors so translucent native frame
